receipts-title = Read receipts
receipts-description = Choose how this account responds when a sender requests a read receipt. A receipt reveals that your mail program displayed the message.
receipts-edit = Edit receipt responses
receipts-response = Response policy
receipts-mode-never = Never send read receipts
receipts-mode-ask = Ask before sending
receipts-mode-always = Send automatically when safe
receipts-mode-contactsOnly = Send automatically to contacts only
receipts-mode-orgOnly = Send automatically inside my organisation only
receipts-mode-orgAlwaysAskOthers = Send inside my organisation; ask for other senders
receipts-safety = Administrator restrictions and receipt safety checks always apply. A different return address or list message cannot silently receive an automatic receipt.
receipts-save = Save receipt policy
receipts-back = Back to read receipts
receipts-unavailable = Read receipt settings are unavailable for this connection.
receipts-load-error = Could not load receipt settings. Reopen this screen to retry.
receipts-save-forbidden = Your administrator does not allow this change. Reopen the editor to refresh its policy.
receipts-save-error = Could not save the receipt policy. Your changes are still in the editor.
receipts-request = { $sender } requests a read receipt. Sending it reveals that this message was displayed.
receipts-send = Send read receipt
receipts-not-now = Not now
receipts-uncertain = The receipt outcome could not be confirmed. It will not be retried automatically.
receipts-senders-title = Sender exceptions
receipts-senders-help = Match one exact email address. Your Never preference and administrator-held policies take precedence. Automatic responses still require a safe return address and non-list mail.
receipts-senders-add = Add sender exception
receipts-senders-editor = Edit sender exception
receipts-sender-address = Sender email address
receipts-sender-decision = Response for this sender
receipts-sender-never = Suppress prompts and automatic receipts
receipts-sender-always = Send automatically when safe
receipts-senders-save = Save sender exception
receipts-senders-remove = Remove sender exception
receipts-senders-load-error = Could not load sender exceptions.
receipts-senders-conflict = Sender exceptions changed elsewhere. Go back and reopen this editor before saving.

receipts-delivery-title = Delivery notification defaults
receipts-delivery-edit = Edit delivery notification default
receipts-delivery-default = Request delivery notifications for new messages when supported
receipts-delivery-description = Choose the initial delivery-notification option for new messages. Each message can choose differently. Your administrator can lock this default or prohibit delivery notifications altogether. A server delivery report does not prove anyone read your message.
